{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes... you're a stick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not just any stick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fell off your tree and now you're on a journey \u2014 not just to return to your trunk, but to prove that even a lifeless piece of wood can <strong>do the impossible</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, bounce, roll and rage your way across floating furniture, garden tools, weird junk, and even industrial machinery in a physically absurd world that\u2019s constantly trying to throw you back to the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games that hate you (but you love anyway), <strong>I Am A Stick</strong> is a brutally challenging platformer where every movement counts, and every fall hurts \u2014 emotionally and physically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can a stick find its way home? You\u2019ll laugh, you\u2019ll scream, and maybe, just maybe... you\u2019ll find meaning in the splinters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3882860?t=1756382084","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882860/a90774d3357fe77b9794fd8aac46023de2b932f2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756382084","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882860/9ab85ba0f57270954946f85bcd886ffdebb681ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756382084","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882860/9ab85ba0f57270954946f85bcd886ffdebb681ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756382084","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes... you're a stick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not just any stick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fell off your tree and now you're on a journey \u2014 not just to return to your trunk, but to prove that even a lifeless piece of wood can <strong>do the impossible</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, bounce, roll and rage your way across floating furniture, garden tools, weird junk, and even industrial machinery in a physically absurd world that\u2019s constantly trying to throw you back to the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games that hate you (but you love anyway), <strong>I Am A Stick</strong> is a brutally challenging platformer where every movement counts, and every fall hurts \u2014 emotionally and physically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can a stick find its way home? You\u2019ll laugh, you\u2019ll scream, and maybe, just maybe... you\u2019ll find meaning in the splinters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["CYCLOPS GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882860/739d88b3a89b559ce07a90ad80ef4d9b38b4422f/header.jpg?t=1756382084","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257172325,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172325/movie480.mp4?t=1756380784","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172325/movie_max.mp4?t=1756380784"},"name":"Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257172325/7e71b9e968697b5c7e83a620e694c129ee930e32/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756380784","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2571